---
<section id="voice" class="bg-dark-background py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="w-6 h-0.5 bg-primary"></span>
      <span class="text-primary text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">Voice &amp; Tone</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-dark-foreground text-[48px] leading-[48px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[-0.96px] mb-4">How M&amp;G Speaks</h2>
    <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-[16px] leading-[26px] max-w-2xl mb-16">Every headline, button label, and paragraph should sound like it came from the same person: a calm, experienced professional who has seen it all and knows how to keep people safe.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="border border-dark-border p-8">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-[20px] font-bold uppercase text-dark-foreground mb-4 tracking-wide">Direct &amp; Professional</h3>
        <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-[15px] leading-[24px]">No fluff. Say what you do and who you are. The audience is event planners, property managers, and school administrators — they want clarity, not poetry.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-dark-border p-8">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-[20px] font-bold uppercase text-dark-foreground mb-4 tracking-wide">Authority Without Arrogance</h3>
        <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-[15px] leading-[24px]">Lead with law enforcement experience and 27+ years of service. That credibility speaks for itself. Never oversell or use hype language.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-dark-border p-8">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-[20px] font-bold uppercase text-dark-foreground mb-4 tracking-wide">Local &amp; Accountable</h3>
        <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-[15px] leading-[24px]">Berks County, PA is home. The tone should feel like a neighbor you trust — reliable, responsive, and personally invested in community safety.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-dark-border p-8">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-[20px] font-bold uppercase text-dark-foreground mb-4 tracking-wide">Action-Oriented</h3>
        <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-[15px] leading-[24px]">Every section should guide the visitor toward contact: call, request a quote, or apply. Passive language has no place here.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>